      "label": "Black Out as Racial Slur",
      "description": "The phrase 'black out' in the text is a racial slur used to demean Black people, implying they are 'black' in a derogatory way. This is not a literal blackout but a coded term for Black people, which is a form of racial stereotyping and hate speech. This knowledge is required to understand the hateful intent of the text.",
