      "instance_name": "hateful_smugness",
      "label": "hateful smug expression",
      "description": "The man in the KKK robe displays a neutral to slightly smug facial expression, which conveys a sense of self-satisfied contempt or superiority. This expression aligns with the hateful message of the text, suggesting a condescending or dismissive attitude toward the targeted group. The smugness is not overtly aggressive but implies a false moral high ground, reinforcing the meme's ironic and hateful tone.",
